# ZvenFit — core rules

Static Webflow site. Source: `public/`, `scripts/`, `functions/`. **Never edit `dist/`.**

After changes: `npm run build` or `npm run dev:watch`.

## APIs (injected at build)

- Lead: `functions/telegram-lead/` → `window.ZVENFIT_LEAD_API`
- Schedule: `functions/fitbase-schedule/` → `window.ZVENFIT_SCHEDULE_API`

## Build markers

HTML contains `<!-- ZvenFit: ... -->` comments replaced by `scripts/build-static.cjs`.
Edit snippets in `scripts/snippets/` or configs — not 26 HTML copies.

## Brand

Keep green `#00d10e`, Roadrage + Roboto. See `TODO.md` "Out of scope".

## Secrets

No tokens in HTML/JS. Use env / GitHub Secrets only.

## Verify

`npm run lint:public` and `npm run test:build`. Full guide: `AGENTS.md`.
